@SomNet.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5031

### Auth
POST {{SomNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo"
}

### System status
GET {{SomNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/system/status

### History timeline (Dom + Sub)
GET {{SomNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/history/timeline?domTarget=demo&subTarget=Slv66&fromDate=2026-09-01&toDate=2026-09-05

### Dom sessions (all subs)
GET {{SomNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/history/sessions?domTarget=demo

### Dom sessions (filtered sub)
GET {{SomNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/history/sessions?domTarget=demo&subTarget=Slv67

### Available subs
GET {{SomNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/subs?domTarget=demo

### Options
GET {{SomNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/options?username=demo

### Save options
PUT {{SomNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/options?username=demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enableSoundAlerts": true,
  "confirmBeforeCommands": false,
  "autoExpandVideoOnMobile": true,
  "mobileVideoExpandDefault": "both",
  "showSessionTimestamps": true,
  "operatorDisplayName": "demo",
  "defaultNotesPrefix": "Session",
  "reconnectIntervalSeconds": 10
}

### Send notification
POST {{SomNet.API_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domTarget": "demo",
  "subTarget": "Slv66",
  "subject": "Upcoming Session",
  "sessionDateTime": "2026-09-10T18:00:00-04:00",
  "customBody": "Please be ready."
}
